</header>

<main id="top">

  <section class="hero wrap">
    <div class="hero-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow" data-it="Il pocket soap" data-en="The pocket soap">Il pocket soap</p>
        <h1 data-it="Il sapone<br>che fa <em>pop</em>." data-en="Soap that<br>goes <em>pop</em>.">Il sapone<br>che fa <em>pop</em>.</h1>
        <p class="lead" data-it="Foglietti di sapone in un pod tondo con clip a moschettone. Si aggancia a borsa, zaino o jeans e ti segue ovunque. Pop, acqua, pulito." data-en="Soap sheets in a round pod with a clip-on strap. It hooks onto your bag, backpack or jeans and goes everywhere with you. Pop, water, clean.">Foglietti di sapone in un pod tondo con clip a moschettone. Si aggancia a borsa, zaino o jeans e ti segue ovunque. Pop, acqua, pulito.</p>
        <a class="btn" href="#shop" data-it="Scegli la fragranza" data-en="Pick your fragrance">Scegli la fragranza</a>
        <div class="hero-meta">
